["ingredients", ["coffee", "100% arabica coffee", "100% ground coffee", "100% pure coffee.", "arabica coffee", "ground coffee", "100% arabica coffee.", "premium international coffee beans. fresh, unroasted coffee beans for customer selection. greater quantities per selected coffee...roast, brew, and enjoy!", "arabica coffee (flavored coffees also contain natural and artificial flavors).", "100% arabica coffee beans", "ingredients: 100% pure coffee.", "two pounds of pure, freshly roasted coffee beans for customer selection...our favorites from rhoadsroast coffees.", "100% arabica coffee beans.", "ground coffee with natural and artificial flavor.", "100% arabica gourmet coffee", "100% pure coffee", "100% arabica gourmet coffee, whole bean", "100% pure unroasted coffee beans", "100% coffee", "honduras comsa marcala shg fair trade organic is not a heavy coffee, but it has a pleasant intensity and brightness that is memorable with hints of cherry balanced by an almond-flavored, dark chocolate body with a sweet caramel finish. roast, brew, and enjoy!", "coffee pods", "100% arabica whole bean coffee", "organic coffee", "arabica coffee, natural and artificial flavors.", "12oz flavored coffee", "arabica", "ethiopian natural sidamo grade 4 guji coffee beans...some of the most unique and fascinating coffees in the world.", "arabica coffee, natural or artifical flavoring", "ground 100% arabica coffee beans.", "100% arabica ground coffee", "100% organic coffee", "ingredients: 100% arabica coffee.", "sugar, creamer [partially hydrogenated vegetable oil (coconut and soybean oils), corn syrup solids, sodium caseinate (a milk derivative), dipotassium phosphate, sugar, mono- and diglycerides, silicon dioxide, sodium stearoyl lactylate, soy lecithin, colored with (annatto, turmeric), artificial flavor], nonfat dry milk, instant coffee, natural and artificial flavors, whey solids, cocoa processed with alkali, sodium aluminosilicate (to prevent caking), carboxymethylcellulose, salt. contains milk and soy. *some flavors may add other ingredients to enhance flavor*", "these coffees have been personally selected by our roasters as having the greatest flavor and most bodied aroma when roasted at a medium (full city) to dark (espresso) roasting level. the flavors nuances are rich and the taste is full-bodied. you will enjoy many cups that are remarkable and pleasantly satisfying!", "roasted coffee", "100% pure coffee beans", "organic arabica coffee", "100% organic arabica coffee certified kosher fair trade", "coffee beans", "100% arabica", "1", "whole bean coffee", "100% certified fair trade organic coffee", "100% kona coffee!!", "purified water", "arabica coffee beans", "100% arabica colombian coffee", "100% arabica beans", "100% premium arabica coffee grown, picked, and graded to our dunkin' standards", "experience the goodness and perfection found in each brew of organic bolivia 'colonial caranavi' coffee. the bolivian yungas has a heavy, full-bodied, mellow, nutty flavor and satisfying taste, a soft acidity and great balance, topped off with a surprising semi-sweet finish.", "false", "100% pure coffee. roasted in new orleans, louisiana", "roasted coffee beans", "100% hand picked specialty coffees, natural and artificlal flavors and jim beam bourbon", "100% premium arabica coffee", "coffee, natural and artificial flavor.", "100% arabica coffee, natural and artificial flavors", "arabica coffee.", "100% specialty grade arabica coffee", "100% arabica coffee with natural and artificial flavors"]]
